    </div>

    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Studying Louisiana's military practices for my book has opened up a new avenue of research. The career of <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span> is a testament to the rich and diverse intellectual life of the department. His work on the history of race and land in Louisiana is a valuable contribution to the field. We are fortunate to have such dedicated and accomplished scholars in our department.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>




